<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Ni-Se-W solution (see Medium No. <a href="/cgi-bin/jcm/jcm_grmd?GRMD=1462">1462</a>)               </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;10.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> ml  </TD></TR>
